msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API 参考"

msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

msgid ""
"Import these classes directly from ``megalibpy``. Start with :class:`MEGAlibSource` to load and "
"edit a source file. Its :attr:`~MEGAlibSource.run_config` and :attr:`~MEGAlibSource.source` "
"properties give you access to the parsed :class:`RunConfig` and :class:`Source` objects."
msgstr ""
"从 ``megalibpy`` 顶层导入这些类。先用 :class:`MEGAlibSource` 读取和编辑源文件，再通过 :attr:`~MEGAlibSource.run_config` "
"与 :attr:`~MEGAlibSource.source` 获取解析后的 :class:`RunConfig` 和 :class:`Source`。"

msgid "Source file"
msgstr "源文件"

msgid "Read and edit a Cosima source file with one run and one source."
msgstr "读取和编辑仅含一个 run 与一个 source 的 Cosima 源文件。"

msgid "Load the global, run, and source parameters from a file."
msgstr "从文件加载全局、run 和 source 参数。"

msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

msgid "Path to the input Cosima ``.source`` file."
msgstr "输入 Cosima ``.source`` 文件路径。"

msgid "Display the global simulation parameters."
msgstr "显示全局模拟参数。"

msgid ""
"Set ``return_table=True`` to return a list of ``[key, value]`` rows and ``should_print=False`` to"
" skip printing the table."
msgstr "``return_table=True`` 返回 ``[key, value]`` 行列表；``should_print=False`` 关闭表格打印。"

msgid "Display the run parameters and, by default, the source parameters."
msgstr "显示 run 参数，默认也显示 source 参数。"

msgid ""
"Set ``source_detail=False`` to show the source as a single :class:`Source` object in the run "
"table. Set ``return_table=True`` to return a list of ``[key, value]`` rows and "
"``should_print=False`` to skip printing the table."
msgstr ""
"``source_detail=False`` 在 run 表中把源显示为单个 :class:`Source` 对象。``return_table=True`` 返回 ``[key, "
"value]`` 行列表；``should_print=False`` 不打印。"

msgid "Display the parameters for the run's source."
msgstr "显示 run 中源的参数。"

msgid "Display the global, run, and source parameters in one table."
msgstr "在一个表中显示全局、run 和 source 参数。"

msgid "The parsed :class:`RunConfig`; accessing it does not execute Cosima."
msgstr "已解析的 :class:`RunConfig`；访问此属性不会执行 Cosima。"

msgid "Compatibility alias for :attr:`run_config`."
msgstr ":attr:`run_config` 的兼容别名。"

msgid "The parsed :class:`Source` associated with the run."
msgstr "与 run 关联的 :class:`Source`。"

msgid "Set the Galactic coordinate of the source."
msgstr "设置源的银河坐标。"

msgid "The new coordinate in the Galactic frame."
msgstr "新的 Galactic 坐标。"

msgid "Set the photon flux of the source."
msgstr "设置源的光子流量。"

msgid "Photon flux in photons per square centimeter per second."
msgstr "光子流量，单位 photons/cm²/s。"

msgid "Write the stored parameters to a Cosima source file."
msgstr "将保存的参数写入 Cosima 源文件。"

msgid "Output path. An existing file at this path is overwritten."
msgstr "输出路径。若存在同名文件会覆盖。"

msgid "Print the parameter table when true. Defaults to false."
msgstr "为 true 时打印参数表，默认 false。"

msgid "Global parameters"
msgstr "全局参数"

msgid "Global simulation parameters shared by the entire Cosima run."
msgstr "整个 Cosima run 共用的全局模拟参数。"

msgid "Create global parameters from a mapping or individual values."
msgstr "从映射或单独的值创建全局参数。"

msgid "A dictionary keyed by Cosima directives. If given, it supplies all the parameter values."
msgstr "以 Cosima 指令为键的字典；提供时由此读取全部参数值。"

msgid "Geometry setup path used by ``Geometry``."
msgstr "``Geometry`` 使用的几何设置路径。"

msgid "Source file format version used by ``Version``."
msgstr "``Version`` 指定的源文件格式版本。"

msgid "Electromagnetic physics list used by ``PhysicsListEM``."
msgstr "``PhysicsListEM`` 指定的电磁物理列表。"

msgid "Simulation information storage mode used by ``StoreSimulationInfo``."
msgstr "``StoreSimulationInfo`` 指定的模拟信息保存模式。"

msgid "Event pre-trigger mode used by ``PreTriggerMode``."
msgstr "``PreTriggerMode`` 指定的事件预触发模式。"

msgid "Read the supported global directives from a Cosima source file."
msgstr "从 Cosima 源文件读取受支持的全局指令。"

msgid "Path to the input ``.source`` file."
msgstr "输入 ``.source`` 文件路径。"

msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

msgid "An instance of BaseParams initialized with the source file."
msgstr "根据源文件初始化的 BaseParams 实例。"

msgid "Return type"
msgstr "返回类型"

msgid "The geometry setup path as specified in the source file."
msgstr "源文件中指定的 geometry 设置路径。"

msgid "The value of the ``Version`` directive."
msgstr "``Version`` 指令的值。"

msgid "The name of the electromagnetic physics list."
msgstr "电磁物理列表名称。"

msgid "The mode used to store simulation information."
msgstr "模拟信息保存模式。"

msgid "The event pre-trigger mode."
msgstr "事件预触发模式。"

msgid "Display the global directives and their values."
msgstr "显示全局指令及其值。"

msgid "Cosima run configuration"
msgstr "Cosima run 配置"

msgid ""
"This object describes a ``Run`` block in a source file; it does not execute Cosima. ``Run`` "
"remains a compatibility alias for ``RunConfig``, and ``MEGAlibSource.run`` remains an alias for "
"``MEGAlibSource.run_config``."
msgstr ""
"该对象描述源文件中的 ``Run`` 块，不执行 Cosima。``Run`` 是 ``RunConfig`` 的兼容别名，``MEGAlibSource.run`` 是 "
"``MEGAlibSource.run_config`` 的兼容别名。"

msgid "Configuration of a ``Run`` block in a Cosima source file."
msgstr "Cosima 源文件中 ``Run`` 块的配置。"

msgid ""
"This object describes input parameters and the associated source. It does not launch Cosima or "
"represent a process execution."
msgstr "描述输入参数及关联 source，不启动 Cosima，也不表示进程执行。"

msgid "Create a run configuration from a mapping or individual values."
msgstr "从映射或单独的值创建 run 配置。"

msgid "Name declared in the ``Run`` directive."
msgstr "``Run`` 指令中声明的名称。"

msgid "Output name specified by the run's ``FileName`` directive."
msgstr "run 的 ``FileName`` 输出名称。"

msgid "Sky orientation specification from ``OrientationSky``."
msgstr "``OrientationSky`` 天空姿态说明。"

msgid "Value of the run's ``Time`` directive."
msgstr "run 的 ``Time`` 值。"

msgid "The source associated with this run."
msgstr "与 run 关联的源。"

msgid "Read a run and its single source from a Cosima source file."
msgstr "从 Cosima 源文件读取一个 run 和唯一源。"

msgid "The run configuration initialized with the source file."
msgstr "根据源文件初始化的 run 配置。"

msgid "The name declared in the ``Run`` directive."
msgstr "``Run`` 指令声明的名称。"

msgid "The output name specified by the run's ``FileName`` directive."
msgstr "run 中 ``FileName`` 指定的输出名称。"

msgid "The raw ``OrientationSky`` specification for the run."
msgstr "run 的原始 ``OrientationSky`` 文本。"

msgid "The value of the run's ``Time`` directive, read from file as text."
msgstr "run 的 ``Time`` 指令值，从文件读取时为文本。"

msgid "The :class:`Source` associated with this run."
msgstr "与 run 关联的 :class:`Source`。"

msgid "Display the run directives and their values."
msgstr "显示 run 指令及其值。"

msgid ""
"Set ``source_detail=True`` to expand the source object into its individual directives. Set "
"``return_table=True`` to return a list of ``[key, value]`` rows and ``should_print=False`` to "
"skip printing."
msgstr ""
"``source_detail=True`` 将源对象展开为各项指令；``return_table=True`` 返回 ``[key, value]`` "
"列表，``should_print=False`` 不打印。"

msgid "The underlying dictionary of run directives and their values."
msgstr "run 指令与值的底层字典。"

msgid "Source parameters"
msgstr "源参数"

msgid "Particle, beam, orientation, spectrum, and flux for one Cosima source."
msgstr "一个 Cosima 源的粒子、beam、姿态、谱和流量。"

msgid "Create a source from a mapping or individual values."
msgstr "从映射或单独的值创建源。"

msgid "Name of the run that references this source."
msgstr "引用此源的 run 名称。"

msgid "Name assigned to the source in the run's ``Source`` directive."
msgstr "run 的 ``Source`` 指令赋予源的名称。"

msgid "Cosima particle type code."
msgstr "Cosima 粒子类型代码。"

msgid "Beam model and its arguments, as used in the ``Beam`` directive."
msgstr "``Beam`` 指令使用的 beam 模型及参数。"

msgid "Orientation specification, such as ``Galactic Fixed -21.6 44.6``."
msgstr "姿态说明，如 ``Galactic Fixed -21.6 44.6``。"

msgid ""
"For direct construction, supply the ``<source>.Spectrum`` entry in ``param_dict`` to store the "
"spectral specification."
msgstr "直接构造时，在 ``param_dict`` 中提供 ``<source>.Spectrum`` 项保存谱定义。"

msgid "The name assigned to the source in the run's ``Source`` directive."
msgstr "run 中 ``Source`` 指令赋予的源名称。"

msgid "The Cosima particle type code, read from file as text."
msgstr "Cosima 粒子类型代码，读取文件时为文本。"

msgid "The beam model and parameters as specified in the source file."
msgstr "源文件中的 beam 模型与参数。"

msgid "The raw orientation specification for this source."
msgstr "该源的原始姿态文本。"

msgid "The spectral model and its arguments as specified in the source file."
msgstr "源文件中的谱模型与参数。"

msgid ""
"A parsed flux is a string. After :meth:`set_flux`, this property returns the value supplied to "
"the setter."
msgstr "解析流量时为字符串；调用 :meth:`set_flux` 后返回 setter 传入值。"

msgid "The source position as an ``astropy.coordinates.SkyCoord``."
msgstr "源位置，类型为 ``astropy.coordinates.SkyCoord``。"

msgid ""
"This property reads the last two orientation values as Galactic latitude and longitude, in that "
"order and in degrees."
msgstr "依次将 orientation 的最后两项读取为银河纬度和经度，单位为度。"

msgid "Display the source directives and their values."
msgstr "显示 source 指令及其值。"

msgid "The underlying dictionary of source directives and their values."
msgstr "source 指令与值的底层字典。"

msgid "Replace latitude and longitude in the existing orientation string."
msgstr "替换现有 orientation 字符串中的纬度和经度。"

msgid "A single position in the Galactic frame. The latitude and longitude are written in degrees."
msgstr "Galactic frame 中的单个位置，以度写入纬度和经度。"

msgid "Set the flux of the source."
msgstr "设置源流量。"

msgid "Cosima simulation"
msgstr "Cosima 模拟"

msgid ""
"Use :meth:`Cosima.simulate` to start an external simulation. Its parameter reference below "
"includes defaults, units, output layout, return values, errors, and the limits of dependency "
"capture. See :doc:`../cosima` for complete examples and the two runtime modes."
msgstr "通过 :meth:`Cosima.simulate` 启动外部模拟。以下参数说明包括默认值、单位、输出布局、返回值、错误与依赖捕获范围。完整示例与两种运行模式见 :doc:`../cosima`。"

msgid "Execute ordinary single-run Cosima event simulations."
msgstr "执行普通单 run Cosima 事件模拟。"

msgid ""
"Defaults to direct execution. A setup-script runtime initializes MEGAlib in a separate Bash "
"process without modifying the calling Python process."
msgstr "默认直接执行。setup-script runtime 在独立 Bash 进程初始化 MEGAlib，不修改调用者 Python 进程。"

msgid ""
"Command name or executable path, defaulting to ``cosima``. Direct mode resolves it before "
"changing the child working directory; setup-script mode resolves it inside the initialized child "
"environment."
msgstr "命令名或可执行路径，默认 ``cosima``。direct 在改变子进程 cwd 前解析，setup-script 在初始化后的子环境内解析。"

msgid "Runtime used for every call to :meth:`simulate` on this instance."
msgstr "本实例每次 :meth:`simulate` 使用的 runtime。"

msgid "type"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "MEGAlibRuntime"
msgstr "MEGAlibRuntime"

msgid "Executable command or path supplied to the selected runtime."
msgstr "传给所选 runtime 的可执行命令或路径。"

msgid "str"
msgstr "str"

msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

msgid ""
"Constructing this object does not start a process or check MEGAlib's availability. Checks occur "
"when :meth:`simulate` is called. This wrapper requires a separate MEGAlib installation and does "
"not import PyROOT."
msgstr "构造不启动进程，也不检查 MEGAlib 是否可用；检查发生在 :meth:`simulate`。需要独立安装 MEGAlib，不导入 PyROOT。"

msgid "Simulate events with Cosima and save an execution record."
msgstr "用 Cosima 模拟事件并保存执行记录。"

msgid ""
"UTF-8 Cosima source file with one inline ``Run`` declaration and one corresponding ``FileName`` "
"directive. Relative paths to this file are resolved against the calling Python working directory."
" Supported relative references inside the file are resolved against the source file's directory. "
"The original file is never modified."
msgstr ""
"UTF-8 Cosima 源文件，包含一个内联 ``Run`` 及对应 ``FileName``。该文件相对路径按调用 Python cwd 解析；文件内受支持的相对资源按 source "
"目录解析。原文件不修改。"

msgid ""
"Experiment root. Missing parents are created; the Cosima stage must not already exist. Its "
"absolute path cannot contain whitespace or ``$``. Creates cosima/inputs, logs and products, plus "
"one root manifest.json. A new experiment is required for every rerun. Supply exactly one of "
"``output_dir`` or ``workspace``."
msgstr ""
"实验根目录，缺失父目录会创建，Cosima stage 不能已存在。绝对路径不能含空白或 ``$``。建立 cosima/inputs、logs、products 及根 "
"manifest.json。每次重跑需要新实验。output_dir 与 workspace 必须且只能选一个。"

msgid ""
"Experiment object or root, default none. Writes directly into cosima/ without an attempt "
"directory. Exactly one Cosima execution is allowed, including failure; retries need a new "
"workspace."
msgstr "实验对象或根，默认 None。直接写入 cosima/，无 attempt 层。只允许一次 Cosima（包括失败），重试需要新 workspace。"

msgid ""
"Positive integer in ``[1, 2147483647]`` passed to Cosima's ``-s`` option. Defaults to ``None``, "
"which generates and records a random seed in that range. Boolean values are rejected."
msgstr "传给 Cosima ``-s`` 的 ``[1, 2147483647]`` 正整数。默认 ``None`` 自动生成并记录随机 seed；拒绝布尔值。"

msgid ""
"If ``True`` (default), pass ``-z`` and discover ``*.sim.gz`` files. If ``False``, pass ``-u`` and"
" discover uncompressed ``*.sim`` files."
msgstr "``True``（默认）传 ``-z`` 并发现 ``*.sim.gz``；``False`` 传 ``-u`` 并发现未压缩 ``*.sim``。"

msgid ""
"Positive wall-clock limit in seconds for the child process, including environment initialization "
"and Cosima execution. Defaults to ``None`` (no limit). Preparation and snapshot copying occur "
"before this timer. A timeout terminates the process group and raises ``ExecutionError``."
msgstr "子进程墙钟超时，正数秒，包含环境初始化和 Cosima，默认 ``None`` 不限时。准备和快照复制发生在计时前。超时终止进程组并抛出 ``ExecutionError``。"

msgid ""
"Additional external files to record, defaulting to an empty tuple. Relative paths are resolved "
"against the source directory. These declarations supplement supported automatically discovered "
"inputs; they do not rewrite arbitrary directives or recursively discover geometry includes."
msgstr "额外登记的外部文件，默认空元组。相对路径按 source 目录解析。它补充自动发现的受支持输入，不改写任意指令或递归发现 geometry includes。"

msgid ""
"Maximum external dependency size to hash, in bytes. Default zero records path, size and mtime "
"without reading nonempty resources. None hashes all discovered/declared resources. Copies are "
"made only when runtime.archive_inputs=True and a file is within this hash limit. Compact mode "
"never copies geometry/orientation/spectrum dependencies. Source bytes and checksums are stored in"
" the manifest by default."
msgstr ""
"外部依赖 hash 大小上限，单位 bytes。默认零只记路径/大小/mtime，不读非空资源；None 对所有已发现/声明资源计算 hash。仅 "
"runtime.archive_inputs=True 且在上限内才复制。精简模式不复制 geometry/orientation/spectrum；source 字节及校验和默认存 "
"manifest。"

msgid ""
"\"full\" (default) streams complete stdout/stderr. \"summary\" streams stdout from the last line "
"starting \"Summary for run \" to EOF, including the complete summary and shutdown text without a "
"size cap. Earlier stdout is discarded while reading, not written first. Stderr is always retained"
" in full. If no summary marker appears, stdout is absent and logs.capture marks summary_missing; "
"no arbitrary tail is substituted. Empty logs are removed. This is a Python capture option, not a "
"native MEGAlib flag."
msgstr ""
"默认 \"full\" 流式保留完整 stdout/stderr。\"summary\" 保留最后一个行首 \"Summary for run \" 到 EOF "
"的全部内容，包括摘要和退出文字，不限大小；之前 stdout 边读边丢，不先落盘。stderr 始终完整。没有标记则 stdout 缺失并记 "
"summary_missing，不代以任意尾部。空日志删除。这是 Python 捕获选项，不是原生 flag。"

msgid ""
"Successful execution with absolute paths to the workspace, logs, and manifest. "
"``result.outputs[\"sim\"]`` is a sorted tuple of one or more nonempty simulation files; no "
"``inc1.id1`` naming assumption is made. ``result.returncode`` is zero."
msgstr ""
"成功结果包含 workspace、日志与 manifest 的绝对路径。``result.outputs[\"sim\"]`` 是排序的非空模拟文件元组，可有多个，不假设 "
"inc1.id1。result.returncode 为零。"

msgid "Raises"
msgstr "异常"

msgid ""
"The seed, hash limit, or timeout is invalid before preparation.     No execution manifest is "
"created for these argument errors."
msgstr "准备前 seed、hash 上限或 timeout 无效。此类参数错误不创建执行 manifest。"

msgid ""
"The execution directory already exists. It is never overwritten     or reused, even if it is "
"empty."
msgstr "执行目录已存在。即使为空也不覆盖或复用。"

msgid "The execution directory or its initial record cannot be created."
msgstr "无法创建执行目录或初始记录。"

msgid ""
"Source/setup preparation, program discovery, process startup,     native execution, timeout, or "
"output validation fails after the     execution record is created. Inspect "
"``error.manifest_path``,     ``error.returncode``, and the files in ``logs/`` for diagnostics."
"     Unsupported source layouts are reported through this exception."
msgstr ""
"建立记录后 source/setup 准备、程序发现、启动、执行、超时或产物校验失败。检查 ``error.manifest_path``、``error.returncode`` 和 "
"logs/。不支持的 source 布局也经此异常报告。"

msgid ""
"The caller interrupts execution. The process group is terminated,     the attempt is recorded as "
"interrupted, and the interrupt is     propagated to the caller."
msgstr "调用者中断执行：终止进程组，记 interrupted，并继续向调用者传播中断。"

msgid "The host is not POSIX-compatible."
msgstr "宿主系统不兼容 POSIX。"

msgid ""
"This synchronous method blocks until the child finishes or fails. It preserves the parent Python "
"environment and working directory. Source comments and unknown directives are retained in the "
"execution copy; ``FileName`` is redirected to ``products/events`` and supported input paths are "
"rebased. Source ``Include`` directives and activation/cross-section jobs are not supported in "
"this version."
msgstr ""
"同步阻塞直到子进程结束或失败，不改父环境/cwd。保留 source 注释和未知指令，FileName 定向 products/events，受支持输入按源目录解析。本版本不支持 source "
"Include 或 activation/cross-section。"

msgid ""
"Dependency capture is explicitly incomplete. Nested geometry includes and runtime-expanded paths "
"require external archival, and external inputs must remain unchanged while the tool runs. Success"
" checks only the exit status and nonempty output files; it does not establish scientific validity"
" or complete gzip integrity."
msgstr "依赖捕获不完整。嵌套 geometry include 和运行时展开路径需外部归档；执行期间输入保持不变。成功仅检查退出码与非空输出，不证明科学有效性或完整 gzip 完整性。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "In an already initialized MEGAlib environment:"
msgstr "已经初始化 MEGAlib 的环境中："

msgid ""
"To initialize a separate MEGAlib environment, pass a :class:`~megalibpy.MEGAlibRuntime` created "
"with ``from_setup_script`` to the ``Cosima`` constructor."
msgstr "要初始化独立 MEGAlib 环境，将用 ``from_setup_script`` 创建的 :class:`~megalibpy.MEGAlibRuntime` 传给 Cosima 构造函数。"

msgid "Runtime selection"
msgstr "运行环境选择"

msgid ""
"Choose :meth:`MEGAlibRuntime.direct` for an already initialized environment, or "
":meth:`MEGAlibRuntime.from_setup_script` to initialize MEGAlib in a Bash child. Both modes "
"preserve the calling Python environment."
msgstr ""
"已初始化环境用 :meth:`MEGAlibRuntime.direct`；需在 Bash 子进程初始化则用 "
":meth:`MEGAlibRuntime.from_setup_script`。均保留调用 Python 环境。"

msgid "MEGAlib runtime selection, independent of individual tool options."
msgstr "MEGAlib 运行环境选择，独立于各工具参数。"

msgid ""
"Use :meth:`direct` for an already initialized environment, or :meth:`from_setup_script` to source"
" a trusted Bash script in a child process. The parent process's environment is never modified."
msgstr "用 :meth:`direct` 选择已初始化环境，或用 :meth:`from_setup_script` 在子进程 source 可信 Bash 脚本。父进程环境始终不改。"

msgid ""
"Absolute path to a trusted Bash initialization script. ``None`` selects direct execution. Prefer "
"the factory methods to constructing this dataclass directly; :meth:`from_setup_script` expands "
"``~`` and resolves relative paths for you."
msgstr "可信 Bash 初始化脚本的绝对路径。None 选择 direct。推荐工厂方法，:meth:`from_setup_script` 会展开 ~ 并解析相对路径。"

msgid "Bash command name or executable path, defaulting to ``\"bash\"``. Used only in setup-script mode."
msgstr "Bash 命令名或路径，默认 ``\"bash\"``，仅 setup-script 模式使用。"

msgid ""
"False (default) records native source/configuration bytes in the root manifest and removes "
"temporary native input files after execution. True retains source/configuration snapshots in "
"inputs/. Setup helpers and executable-path handoff files are temporary in both modes."
msgstr "默认 False 将 source/cfg 字节存根 manifest，执行后删除临时原生输入。True 在 inputs/ 保留实体快照。两种模式下启动和可执行路径传递文件均临时。"

msgid "Script selected for initialization, or ``None`` in direct mode."
msgstr "选定的初始化脚本，direct 模式为 None。"

msgid "pathlib.Path or None"
msgstr "pathlib.Path or None"

msgid "Bash executable selected for setup-script mode."
msgstr "setup-script 模式选用的 Bash 可执行文件。"

msgid ""
"Both modes launch external processes. Setup-script mode removes common inherited Python and "
"native-library search paths, then sources the script and executes the tool in the same Bash "
"child. The script must establish the complete runtime; this is not a container or fully hermetic "
"environment. Scripts are executed from their original location so ``BASH_SOURCE``-based resource "
"lookup continues to work. Only load scripts you trust."
msgstr ""
"均启动外部进程。setup-script 清除常见继承 Python/动态库路径，随后同一 Bash 子进程 source 并执行工具。脚本必须建立完整 "
"runtime；这不是容器或完全隔离环境。脚本始终从原位置执行，保留 BASH_SOURCE 查找资源的能力。仅加载可信脚本。"

msgid "Select direct execution in the current process environment."
msgstr "选择当前进程环境中的直接执行。"

msgid ""
"Default false stores configuration content in the manifest; true retains source/config files. "
"Launch helpers are always temporary."
msgstr "默认 false 将配置内容存 manifest，true 保留 source/cfg 文件；启动文件始终临时。"

msgid ""
"Runtime with no setup script. Tool availability is checked later, when an execution is prepared; "
"this factory does not launch a tool."
msgstr "不含 setup 脚本的 runtime。工厂不启动工具；程序可用性在执行准备时检查。"

msgid "Select environment initialization in a separate Bash child."
msgstr "选择在独立 Bash 子进程中初始化环境。"

msgid ""
"Trusted Bash script to source before executing a tool. ``~`` is expanded and relative paths are "
"resolved against the calling Python working directory. The script may activate a separate Conda "
"environment and must establish MEGAlib's runtime paths."
msgstr "工具执行前 source 的可信脚本。展开 ~，相对路径以调用 Python cwd 解析。可激活独立 Conda，必须建立 MEGAlib 所需路径。"

msgid ""
"Bash executable name or path, defaulting to ``\"bash\"``. Login and interactive startup files are"
" not automatically loaded."
msgstr "Bash 名称或路径，默认 ``\"bash\"``。不自动加载 login 或 interactive 启动文件。"

msgid ""
"False (default) stores source/configuration content in the manifest; true retains their files in "
"inputs/. Helpers remain temporary."
msgstr "默认 False 将 source/cfg 内容存 manifest，True 在 inputs/ 保留文件；helper 始终临时。"

msgid ""
"Runtime containing the resolved script path. This method neither sources the script nor verifies "
"its existence. Missing scripts or Bash executables are reported when an execution is prepared."
msgstr "包含已解析脚本路径的 runtime。此方法不 source 或检查脚本存在性；缺失脚本或 Bash 在准备执行时报告。"

msgid ""
"Environment changes occur only in the child process. The calling Python process remains in its "
"original environment. The initialization script and tool arguments are passed as positional "
"parameters rather than interpolated into shell syntax."
msgstr "环境变化只发生在子进程，调用者 Python 保持原环境。初始化脚本和工具参数以位置参数传递，不插入 shell 语法。"

msgid "Standalone native command"
msgstr "独立原生命令"

msgid "Run one native command in a MEGAlib runtime without a workspace."
msgstr "不创建工作区，在 MEGAlib runtime 中运行一条原生命令。"

msgid ""
"Nonempty argv sequence, beginning with the executable name or path. Each argument is passed "
"literally with shell=False. Shell command strings, pipelines, redirections and variable expansion"
" are not parsed. Format numeric native values as strings before passing them."
msgstr "非空 argv 序列，以可执行名称或路径开始。每项按字面传入 shell=False，不解析 shell 字符串、管道、重定向或变量展开。数值原生参数应先格式化为字符串。"

msgid ""
"Runtime to initialize in the child, default None (direct mode). from_setup_script() sources its "
"trusted script before executing the command, even if the parent shell has no MEGAlib environment."
" The parent's environment and working directory remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"子进程 runtime，默认 None 为 direct。from_setup_script() 即使父 shell 没有 MEGAlib 也会先 source 可信脚本再执行。不修改父环境或 "
"cwd。"

msgid ""
"Child working directory. None (default) inherits the caller's directory. No directory is created;"
" relative resource/output paths use this base."
msgstr "子进程 cwd。默认 None 继承调用者目录。不创建目录，相对资源和输出以此为基准。"

msgid ""
"Positive timeout in seconds, including initialization. None (default) waits indefinitely. Process"
" termination follows subprocess.run()."
msgstr "包含初始化的正数秒超时；默认 None 无限等待。终止行为遵循 subprocess.run()。"

msgid ""
"True (default) raises subprocess.CalledProcessError on nonzero exit. False returns the process "
"status, including setup or tool-discovery failures that occur inside the child."
msgstr "默认 True 在非零退出时抛 subprocess.CalledProcessError；False 返回状态，包括子进程内 setup 或程序发现失败。"

msgid ""
"False (default) inherits stdout/stderr without capturing them in memory. True captures both, "
"including setup output, as UTF-8 strings with invalid bytes replaced. Capture is unbounded; use "
"only for suitable log volumes."
msgstr "默认 False 继承 stdout/stderr，不捕获到内存。True 捕获两路（包括 setup 输出）为 UTF-8 字符串，替换无效字节。不限制大小，请按日志量选择。"

msgid ""
"Original native args and returncode; stdout/stderr are strings when captured, otherwise None. "
"This is not an ExecutionResult and has no manifest, execution ID, discovered products or "
"provenance registration."
msgstr ""
"返回原生 args 和 returncode；捕获时 stdout/stderr 为字符串，否则 None。不是 ExecutionResult，不含 manifest、execution "
"ID、自动发现产物或来源登记。"

msgid ""
"command is a shell string, an argument is not text/path-like, or runtime     is not a "
"MEGAlibRuntime."
msgstr "command 为 shell 字符串、参数不是文本/路径类型，或 runtime 不是 MEGAlibRuntime。"

msgid "Empty argv/executable, invalid boolean options or nonpositive timeout."
msgstr "argv/可执行名称为空、布尔选项无效或 timeout 非正。"

msgid "Direct-mode executable, setup script, Bash or cwd cannot be found."
msgstr "找不到 direct 可执行程序、setup 脚本、Bash 或 cwd。"

msgid ""
"Initialization or command exits nonzero and check=True. cmd identifies     the original native "
"argv, not a removed temporary launch script."
msgstr "初始化或命令非零退出且 check=True。cmd 指向原始 argv，不是已删除的临时启动脚本。"

msgid "Timeout expires. cmd identifies the original argv."
msgstr "超时。cmd 为原始 argv。"

msgid "Temporary helper creation or process launch fails."
msgstr "创建临时 helper 或启动进程失败。"

msgid ""
"Uses the same runtime bootstrap as managed execution, including environment separation and the "
"ROOT-compatible script launcher. Temporary helpers are removed on success, failure and timeout. "
"No workspace/manifest, cfg archive, automatic -n/-x flags, output validation or file protection "
"is added. Native commands may create or overwrite outputs according to their own rules. "
"runtime.archive_inputs does not apply to this unmanaged command."
msgstr ""
"复用受管理执行的 runtime bootstrap，包括环境分离和兼容 ROOT 的脚本启动方式。成功、失败、超时均清理 helper。不添加 workspace/manifest、cfg "
"归档、自动 -n/-x、输出检查或文件保护。原生命令按自身规则创建或覆盖文件；runtime.archive_inputs 不适用于此入口。"

msgid "Revan reconstruction"
msgstr "Revan 重建"

msgid ""
"Use an explicit configuration and geometry; see :doc:`../revan` for native settings isolation, "
"input selection and examples."
msgstr "请显式设置配置与 geometry；原生设置隔离、输入选择与示例见 :doc:`../revan`。"

msgid "Reconstruct native event data with an explicit native MEGAlib configuration."
msgstr "用显式原生 MEGAlib 配置重建事件数据。"

msgid "Shared direct/setup-script runtime. ``None`` selects direct execution."
msgstr "共用 direct/setup-script runtime，None 选择直接执行。"

msgid ""
"Experiment root, default none. Bind the directory containing the root manifest and sibling "
"cosima/, revan/ and mimrec/ directories, never a stage, analysis or product directory. Calls can "
"omit working_space; explicit results/references must belong to this same root. External event-"
"file calls use this root as their destination when output_dir is omitted. Construction reads "
"metadata but creates no files or processes. Conflicting per-call workspace/output_dir values "
"raise ValueError."
msgstr ""
"实验根，默认 None。应绑定包含根 manifest 和同级 cosima/revan/mimrec 的目录，不能是 stage/分析/产物目录。后续可省 "
"working_space；显式结果/引用必须属于同根。外部事件调用省 output_dir 时以此为目标。构造只读元数据，不建文件或进程。方法级根或目标冲突抛 ValueError。"

msgid ""
"Workspace-local reconstruction analysis name, default none. A bound name writes all calls to "
"revan/<analysis_id> and reuses its recorded defaults when config_file is omitted. None creates a "
"numbered group per call. Names use letters, digits, underscores and hyphens, starting with a "
"letter/digit. Construction creates no files and launches no process."
msgstr ""
"workspace 内重建分析名，默认 None。绑定后所有调用写入 revan/<analysis_id>，省 cfg 则复用记录基准。None "
"每次分配编号组。名称为字母/数字/下划线/连字符，首字符为字母/数字。构造不创建文件或进程。"

msgid "Native executable name or path, default ``\"revan\"``."
msgstr "原生程序名或路径，默认 ``\"revan\"``。"

msgid ""
"Main opaque native cfg, default None. Supplying it binds its nonempty bytes and resource cwd at "
"construction and requires working_space and analysis_id. Construction reads "
"metadata/configuration only and writes no files or processes. A recorded bound definition is "
"restored when reopening without this argument, even if the original file was removed. Different "
"main bytes or resource cwd require a new analysis_id."
msgstr ""
"主 opaque cfg，默认 None。提供时在构造冻结非空字节与资源 cwd，要求 working_space 和 "
"analysis_id。只读取元数据/配置，不创建文件或启动进程。重开可省略以恢复已记录定义，即使原文件已删除。主字节或 cwd 不同要求新 analysis_id。"

msgid ""
"Baseline literal -g value, default None (omit -g in a new definition; restore the saved setting "
"when reopening). Never parsed or inspected. A different bound geometry requires a new "
"analysis_id."
msgstr "基准字面 -g 值，默认 None（新定义省略 -g，重开恢复已记录值）。不解析或检查文件。绑定 geometry 不同要求新 analysis_id。"

msgid ""
"Baseline native -C settings: key underscores become dots, booleans become true/false and other "
"values use str. Native text is frozen at construction. reconstruct() overrides apply only to that"
" execution."
msgstr "基准原生 -C 设置：键下划线转点，布尔转 true/false，其他用 str。构造冻结原生文本；reconstruct() 覆盖仅作用于本次。"

msgid ""
"Invalid identifier, missing bound root/analysis_id/configuration, empty     cfg or conflicting "
"recorded baseline. Different baselines need a new ID."
msgstr "标识符无效、缺少绑定根/analysis_id/配置、cfg 为空或与已记录基准冲突。不同基准需新 ID。"

msgid "An explicitly supplied configuration file cannot be read."
msgstr "无法读取显式配置文件。"

msgid ""
"A removed analysis directory with only failed executions may be reopened under the same "
"analysis_id with corrected constructor settings. The next command rechecks eligibility under the "
"manifest lock, preserves old failed records and recreates the layout with a fresh baseline. "
"Construction writes nothing. Existing, successful or in-progress groups remain protected. No "
"PyROOT is imported. Geometry, input and output CLI arguments override saved file selections in "
"the supplied configuration. Native configuration bytes are passed through unchanged; no "
"configuration parser, serializer or fixed Python settings model is used."
msgstr ""
"仅有失败执行且整个目录已删除的组，可同 ID 修正构造基准。下次命令在 manifest 锁内重查资格，保留旧失败并重建布局。构造不写文件；目录存在、有成功或在途执行仍受保护。不导入 "
"PyROOT。geometry/input/output CLI 覆盖原生配置中的相应选择。cfg 原样传递，无解析器、序列化器或固定 Python 设置模型。"

msgid "Reconstruct one native event file into a recorded ``tra`` product."
msgstr "重建一个原生事件入口，记录为 ``tra`` 产物。"

msgid ""
"Defaults to the constructor-bound root, if supplied. Otherwise none. Existing experiment/legacy "
"Cosima directory, result, or explicit upstream reference. Without a bound root, supply exactly "
"one of ``working_space`` or ``sim_path``. Multiple declared files require explicit selection. "
"Externally started experiments can be reopened here using their recorded input file."
msgstr ""
"默认使用构造绑定根，否则 None。可传既有实验、旧 Cosima 目录、结果或上游引用。未绑定时 working_space 与 sim_path "
"恰选其一；多文件需显式选择。外部起点的实验也可通过登记输入重开。"

msgid ""
"External ``.sim[.gz]`` or ``.evta[.gz]`` entry file, default none. Requires ``output_dir`` or a "
"constructor-bound working_space root. The file stays in place; no simulation contents are read, "
"copied or hashed. Any native continuation references remain MEGAlib's responsibility."
msgstr ""
"外部 ``.sim[.gz]`` 或 ``.evta[.gz]``，默认 None。需 output_dir 或构造绑定根。数据留原位，不读取/复制/hash 模拟内容。continuation"
" 引用由 MEGAlib 处理。"

msgid ""
"Default None uses the construction-bound configuration. In that mode an explicit file must have "
"identical bytes and resource cwd; changing the main cfg requires a new analysis_id. Legacy calls "
"without a bound definition require a cfg for a new group. None in legacy mode restores a named "
"analysis group's saved bytes, original cwd, geometry and overrides. Original bytes are copied "
"unchanged to the execution snapshot and passed to Revan via ``-c``. No syntax, field names or "
"values are interpreted. Relative resources resolve from this file's parent directory."
msgstr ""
"默认 None 使用构造绑定 cfg；此模式下显式文件必须同字节与资源 cwd，修改主 cfg 要新 ID。无定义旧入口新组需 cfg；省略则恢复组内字节、原 cwd、geometry "
"和覆盖。原文通过临时快照以 -c 传 Revan，不解释语法/字段/值。相对资源以配置父目录为基准。"

msgid ""
"Default None uses construction-bound geometry when present; a different bound geometry requires a"
" new analysis_id. In legacy mode, with explicit config_file, None omits -g and uses the cfg "
"geometry. With inherited configuration it reuses the bound defaults. Otherwise forwarded "
"unchanged to ``-g``; MEGAlib handles path expansion, opening and overriding. Python does not "
"inspect the file. Relative paths use the child cwd (the configuration directory)."
msgstr ""
"默认 None 复用已绑定 geometry，修改要求新 ID。旧入口显式 cfg 时 None 省 -g，由 cfg 决定；继承配置时复用 defaults。其他值原样传 "
"-g，路径展开/打开/覆盖归 MEGAlib。Python 不检查文件，相对路径按子 cwd（配置目录）。"

msgid ""
"Destination experiment root, required with ``sim_path``. Creates ``manifest.json`` and ``revan"
"/attempt-NNN`` below it; it is not an individual attempt directory. Existing matching experiments"
" can be reused for new data groups. Legacy inputs require a fresh destination; their original "
"directories are read-only. With ``working_space``, omission continues in that experiment; an "
"explicit root records the existing Cosima origin by reference. Defaults to none."
msgstr ""
"目标实验根，外部 sim_path 时必需（或由绑定根提供）。在其下创建 manifest.json 与 revan/attempt-"
"NNN，不是单次目录。相同既有实验可增加组；旧输入需新目标，旧目录只读。working_space 省目标则原地接续，显式新根按引用保留原 Cosima origin。默认 None。"

msgid ""
"Named reconstruction task, default ``\"default\"``. Workspace attempts are numbered under "
"``revan/``. Labels remain queryable metadata, without another directory level. With analysis_id "
"bound, repeated calls share that group; only occupied output filenames gain numeric suffixes. "
"Without a bound ID, each call creates a new numbered group."
msgstr "任务标签，默认 ``\"default\"``。未绑定时在 revan/ 分配编号组；标签是元数据，不增加目录层。绑定 ID 时重复调用共享组，只对冲突输出名编号。"

msgid ""
"Default true produces ``products/events.tra.gz``; false uses ``.tra``. Compression is selected "
"through the output suffix, not Cosima flags."
msgstr "默认 true 生成 products/events.tra.gz，false 为 .tra。按后缀选择压缩，不使用 Cosima flag。"

msgid ""
"Positive child-process timeout in seconds, including setup. None waits indefinitely. "
"Preparation/final record writing are excluded."
msgstr "包含 setup 的正数秒超时；None 无限等待，不含准备与最终记录写入。"

msgid ""
"Default false retains native HOME/settings behavior. Explicit true gives the tool a private HOME "
"after setup. Configuration contents remain unchanged, so HOME-based paths then use the private "
"HOME."
msgstr "默认 false 保留原生 HOME。true 在 setup 后给工具私有 HOME，不改配置内容；基于 HOME 的路径也转向该目录。"

msgid ""
"\"full\" (default) streams complete stdout/stderr without a byte cap. Summary selection is "
"currently available only for Cosima, whose native boundary marker is defined. Empty logs are "
"removed. This Python option is never forwarded as a native -C setting."
msgstr "默认 \"full\" 流式保留完整 stdout/stderr，无字节上限。summary 当前仅 Cosima 支持；空日志删除。此 Python 选项绝不转发原生 -C。"

msgid ""
"Native configuration overrides. Each keyword's underscores become dots: ``TotalEnergy_Min=100`` "
"gives ``-C TotalEnergy.Min=100``. Values are passed as one argument without path/value rewriting;"
" booleans become ``true``/``false``, other values use ``str``. Field existence, value validity "
"and external files are MEGAlib's concern. In construction-bound mode these affect THIS COMMAND "
"ONLY; they never replace the constructor baseline or later calls' defaults. Both "
"execution_overrides and analysis_baseline_overrides are saved. CLI ``-g/-f/-o`` selections take "
"precedence according to native rules."
msgstr ""
"原生覆盖：关键字下划线转点，如 ``TotalEnergy_Min=100`` 生成 ``-C TotalEnergy.Min=100``。值为独立参数，不改路径或文本；布尔 "
"true/false，其他 str。字段、值、外部文件由 MEGAlib 判断。绑定模式仅影响本次，不改变构造基准/后续默认；分别记录 execution_overrides 与 "
"analysis_baseline_overrides。CLI -g/-f/-o 优先级按原生规则。"

msgid ""
"``outputs[\"tra\"]`` contains the reconstructed file. The execution manifest records "
"configuration hashes, CLI overrides, runtime and selected upstream input. Managed results also "
"expose ``workspace_dir``."
msgstr "``outputs[\"tra\"]`` 包含重建文件。manifest 记录配置 hash、CLI 覆盖、runtime 与精确上游；受管理结果另有 workspace_dir。"

msgid "Invalid arguments, unsupported/ambiguous inputs or workspace selection."
msgstr "参数无效、输入不支持/有歧义或 workspace 选择错误。"

msgid "Input selection cannot be resolved before allocation."
msgstr "分配前无法解析输入。"

msgid "An attempt path is occupied or the experiment index is locked."
msgstr "attempt 路径占用或实验索引锁定。"

msgid ""
"Configuration snapshot preparation, launch, execution, timeout or     nonempty-output checks fail"
" after an attempt record is established."
msgstr "建立记录后配置快照、启动、执行、超时或非空输出检查失败。"

msgid "Execution is interrupted; diagnostics are retained."
msgstr "执行中断，保留诊断。"

msgid "Warns"
msgstr "警告"

msgid ""
"**UserWarning** -- In legacy groups without a construction-bound definition, settings differ from"
" the saved defaults. The variant is recorded without replacing its saved baseline."
msgstr "**UserWarning** -- 无构造绑定的旧组设置与默认不同，记录变体但不替换原基准。"

msgid ""
"By default, native Revan uses its usual HOME and settings. Optional isolation changes HOME only "
"for the tool after setup, without altering the parent's environment or rewriting configuration "
"contents. No configuration syntax or settings semantics are checked by Python; native Revan may "
"diagnose errors or fall back to defaults. Inspect logs. A zero exit status plus nonempty output "
"is not a scientific check. External configuration files are managed by MEGAlib and the caller."
msgstr ""
"默认 Revan 使用通常 HOME/设置。可选隔离只在 setup 后更改工具 HOME，不改父环境或配置文本。Python 不检查配置语法/语义；原生 Revan "
"可能报错或回退默认，请看日志。零退出和非空输出不是科学检查。外部配置资源由 MEGAlib 与调用者管理。"

msgid "Mimrec selection and analysis"
msgstr "Mimrec 筛选与分析"

msgid ""
"See :doc:`../mimrec` for event extraction, imaging, spectra and ARM. Revan and Mimrec bind named "
"analysis groups at construction. Mimrec separately names its Revan parent and own analysis; see "
":doc:`../workspaces`."
msgstr ""
"事件提取、成像、谱与 ARM 见 :doc:`../mimrec`。Revan/Mimrec 构造绑定命名分析组，Mimrec 分别命名 Revan 父节点和自身组，见 "
":doc:`../workspaces`。"

msgid "Run independent native Mimrec operations without importing PyROOT."
msgstr "不导入 PyROOT，独立执行原生 Mimrec 操作。"

msgid "Direct or setup-script runtime. None selects direct execution."
msgstr "direct 或 setup-script runtime；None 为直接执行。"

msgid ""
"Explicit upstream Revan analysis name. Workspace entry selects this Revan group when the Mimrec "
"group has no successful extraction or saved entry. Default none allows an explicit result or "
"unambiguous legacy input. A supplied name must match the actual recorded Revan provenance."
msgstr "上游 Revan 分析名。workspace 入口在没有本组提取或保存入口时选择该父组。默认 None 可用显式结果或无歧义旧输入。提供名称时必须与真实 Revan 来源一致。"

msgid ""
"Mimrec's own workspace-local group name. Defaults to revan_analysis_id when supplied, otherwise "
"none. A bound name places all calls under mimrec/<analysis_id>, reusing that group's defaults. A "
"workspace input uses the group's unique successful extraction first, then its recorded input, "
"otherwise the explicitly bound revan_analysis_id. Explicit input results preserve their exact "
"upstream identity, allowing differently named Mimrec branches from one Revan result. It "
"identifies data/configuration context, not a command execution or configuration hash. "
"Construction creates no files and runs no process. Names use letters, digits, underscores or "
"hyphens, starting with a letter or digit. The same name can be reused in independent workspaces."
msgstr ""
"Mimrec 自身组名。提供 revan_analysis_id 时默认同名，否则 None。绑定后写 mimrec/<analysis_id> 并复用组基准。workspace "
"选择优先唯一成功提取，再登记输入或精确绑定 Revan；显式结果保留精确来源，可从一个 Revan 分出不同名 Mimrec。名称表示数据/配置，不是命令 "
"ID/hash。构造不写文件或启动；合法字符为字母/数字/下划线/连字符，首字符字母/数字。独立 workspace 可复用同名。"

msgid "Native executable name or path, default ``\"mimrec\"``."
msgstr "原生程序名或路径，默认 ``\"mimrec\"``。"

msgid ""
"Main opaque native configuration, default None. Supplying it enables a bound analysis definition "
"and requires working_space and analysis_id (the latter may default to revan_analysis_id). Bytes "
"and resource cwd are fixed at construction; construction runs no command and writes no files. "
"Reopening a bound group may omit this argument to restore its recorded bytes even if the original"
" cfg was removed. Different main bytes or resource cwd require a new analysis_id."
msgstr ""
"主 opaque cfg，默认 None。提供后启用绑定定义，要求 working_space 与 analysis_id（可默认用 "
"revan_analysis_id）。构造冻结字节/cwd，不执行/写文件。重开可省略以恢复记录，即使原 cfg 删除。主字节/cwd 改变要求新 ID。"

msgid ""
"Baseline literal geometry override. None (default) omits -g for a new definition or restores a "
"recorded definition's setting. Never parsed or checked as a resource. Changing a bound value "
"requires a new ID."
msgstr "基准字面 geometry 覆盖，默认 None：新定义省 -g，重开恢复设置。不解析或检查资源。绑定值改变要求新 ID。"

msgid ""
"Exact primary TRA result/reference or external TRA path. Default None resolves the registered "
"primary input or unique specified Revan parent. Multiple Revan executions require an explicit "
"result; no latest rule. An external path requires working_space and analysis_id. A result can "
"supply its workspace when working_space is omitted."
msgstr ""
"精确主 TRA 结果/引用或外部路径。默认 None 解析登记主输入或唯一指定 Revan 父节点。多 Revan 执行需显式结果，不选最新。外部路径需根与 "
"analysis_id；结果可在省根时提供自己的 workspace。"

msgid ""
"Prepared TRA results/references or file paths, default None. Components are bound with the "
"primary input, not interpreted as background/GRB. None restores a recorded definition; an empty "
"iterable explicitly means no components. Different inputs require a new analysis_id. "
"extract_events() reads the primary and these components together via one native -x command. No "
"separate combination call is required."
msgstr ""
"准备好的 TRA 结果/引用/路径，默认 None。与主输入绑定，不按背景/GRB 分类。None 恢复记录，空可迭代显式表示无成分。数据变化要求新 ID。extract_events() "
"通过一次原生 -x 读取主数据与成分，无需先组合。"

msgid ""
"Baseline native overrides. Keys replace underscores with dots for -C; values are unchanged except"
" booleans become true/false. Method overrides apply only to that command and never replace these "
"baseline defaults."
msgstr "基准原生覆盖。键下划线转点，布尔转 true/false，其他值保持；方法覆盖只用于该命令，不取代默认基准。"

msgid ""
"A removed analysis directory with only failed executions may be reopened under the same "
"analysis_id with corrected constructor settings. The next command rechecks eligibility under the "
"manifest lock, preserves old failed records and recreates the layout with a fresh baseline. "
"Construction writes nothing. Existing, successful or in-progress groups remain protected. "
"Configurations are opaque snapshots. MEGAlib controls event selection, configuration semantics, "
"geometry and external resources. Each call runs one native operation with an independent "
"execution record in a shared data group. A bound analysis_id avoids repeating group selection; "
"actual input data still comes from the bound workspace or each call's explicit input. task names "
"an operation output folder inside that group. None preserves result-based automatic grouping."
msgstr ""
"全部执行失败且整个目录已删除时，可同 ID 更正基准，下次命令在锁内重查、保留旧记录并重建。构造只读；已有目录、成功或在途组受保护。配置保持 opaque，事件选择/语义/资源由 MEGAlib"
" 控制。每次操作独立记录，共享数据组。analysis_id 省去重复选组，但输入仍来自绑定根或精确方法结果。task 是组内输出目录标签；None 保留旧结果自动分组。"

msgid "Combine the primary and constructor-declared TRA components via native -x."
msgstr "通过原生 -x 合并主数据与构造声明 TRA 成分。"

msgid ""
"Output directory label within the analysis, default ``\"components\"``. It does not identify data"
" or participate in downstream selection."
msgstr "组内输出目录标签，默认 ``\"components\"``。不标识数据，也不参与下游选择。"

msgid ""
"Native .tra/.tra.gz filename, default ``\"combined.tra.gz\"``. Existing outputs receive a new "
"suffix; previous results are never overwritten."
msgstr "原生 TRA 文件名，默认 ``\"combined.tra.gz\"``，冲突加新后缀，不覆盖历史。"

msgid "Native-command timeout in seconds, default None (no time limit)."
msgstr "原生命令超时，秒，默认 None 不限时。"

msgid ""
"False (default) preserves native HOME. True isolates native settings for this command only, "
"without modifying the configuration."
msgstr "默认 False 保留原生 HOME，True 仅隔离本次设置，不改 cfg。"

msgid "Python log capture, currently only ``\"full\"`` (default)."
msgstr "Python 日志捕获，目前只支持默认 ``\"full\"``。"

msgid ""
"Overrides for this combination command only, on top of the bound main configuration and baseline "
"overrides. Keys map _ to . for -C. They do not inherit time selections from component "
"preparation."
msgstr "叠加在主 cfg/基准上的本次组合覆盖，键 _ 转 .。不继承成分准备时的时间选择。"

msgid ""
"Native mixed TRA in outputs['tra'], with an independent execution ID and every supplied "
"result/reference recorded as a real upstream. Raw external paths are recorded separately with "
"size/mtime only."
msgstr "outputs[\"tra\"] 中的混合 TRA，有独立 execution ID，全部结果/引用作为真实上游；裸外部路径单独登记 size/mtime。"

msgid ""
"No bound definition/components, changed input, invalid output/label,     or inconsistent analysis"
" definition. A new dataset needs a new ID."
msgstr "无绑定定义/成分、输入改变、输出/标签无效或定义冲突。新数据集需新 ID。"

msgid "Native preparation/execution fails; the failed record is retained."
msgstr "原生准备/执行失败，保留失败记录。"

msgid ""
"Optional explicit materialization; ordinary analyses call extract_events() directly, which "
"already includes the declared components in one -x. This method executes mimrec -x on an IN/END "
"list using the main configuration plus this call's overrides. Native selections still apply; this"
" is not unfiltered byte concatenation. No event parser, time shift, exposure/flux scaling or "
"background classification is added. The list content is recorded in the manifest and its native "
"file is temporary unless archive_inputs=True. The workspace's primary origin is preserved. Later "
"operations select a unique successful extraction first, otherwise a unique successful "
"combination. Multiple candidates require input_data."
msgstr ""
"可选显式物化；普通分析直接 extract_events() 已包含一次 -x 组合。本方法用 IN/END 列表及主 cfg/本次覆盖运行 "
"-x，仍应用原生筛选，并非无筛选字节拼接。不解析事件、不移动时钟、不缩放曝光/流量、不分类背景。列表内容存 manifest，默认临时文件，archive_inputs=True 才保留。主 "
"origin 不变。下游先选唯一提取，再唯一组合，多候选需 input_data。"

msgid "Execute native Mimrec extract_events (-x) with explicit data provenance."
msgstr "执行原生 Mimrec extract_events (-x)，记录精确来源。"

msgid ""
"Legacy per-command workspace/result entry, default None. Prefer binding the root in Mimrec() and "
"selecting results with input_data. Must not conflict with input_data or the constructor-bound "
"root."
msgstr "旧方法级 workspace/结果入口，默认 None。推荐构造绑定根，input_data 指定结果；不得与显式输入或绑定根冲突。"

msgid ""
"Exact TRA result/reference for this command, default None. For a bound analysis it must belong to"
" that analysis's data chain. With declared external_components, None reads the primary and all "
"declared components together via one native IN/END list and -x. Every such call starts from the "
"declared dataset, not a prior extraction. An explicit previous result re-filters only that TRA; "
"components are not added again. Without declared components, None queries the root manifest (not "
"the filesystem): select this group's unique successful extract_events record first, otherwise its"
" unique successful add_external_components record, otherwise the registered primary input. "
"Multiple successful candidates require an explicit result, never latest/mtime or a fixed task "
"folder name."
msgstr ""
"本次精确 TRA 结果/引用，默认 None；绑定模式必须属于自身数据链。有 external_components 时，None 用一次 IN/END+-x "
"读取主输入及全部成分，每次从声明集开始；显式旧结果只重筛它，不再加成分。无成分时按根 manifest 依次选择本组唯一成功 extract_events、唯一成功 "
"add_external_components、登记 primary。多候选必须明确，不按 latest/mtime/固定 task 文件夹选择。"

msgid ""
"Legacy external TRA entry, default None. Requires output_dir or a constructor-bound workspace. "
"For the new bound-definition API, declare the primary path as input_data in Mimrec(), not here."
msgstr "旧外部 TRA 入口，默认 None，需 output_dir 或绑定根。新绑定 API 应在构造 input_data 声明主路径。"

msgid ""
"Legacy destination experiment root, default None. Bound definitions fix their destination in "
"Mimrec() and reject per-command changes."
msgstr "旧目标实验根，默认 None。绑定定义在构造固定目标，拒绝逐命令改变。"

msgid ""
"Default None uses the constructor-bound main configuration or saved group default. In a bound "
"definition an explicit file must have the same bytes and resource cwd; a different main cfg "
"requires a new analysis_id. Legacy calls require a cfg when creating a new group. Native bytes "
"are opaque and are never parsed or edited."
msgstr "默认 None 用构造主 cfg 或组默认。绑定模式显式文件必须同字节/cwd，不同主 cfg 需新 ID；旧入口新组需 cfg。不解析或编辑原生字节。"

msgid ""
"Default None reuses bound geometry, or saved legacy defaults when cfg is omitted. A different "
"geometry in a bound definition requires a new analysis_id. The literal -g value is never read or "
"rewritten."
msgstr "默认 None 复用绑定 geometry；旧入口省 cfg 时复用保存设置。绑定值不同需新 ID，字面 -g 不读取或重写。"

msgid ""
"Arbitrary output directory label, default \"extract_events\". Letters, digits, underscores and "
"hyphens, starting with a letter/digit. inputs/logs are reserved. This is NOT the operation "
"identity and does not identify which extracted TRA a downstream command reads."
msgstr "输出目录标签，默认 \"extract_events\"。字母/数字/下划线/连字符，首字符字母/数字；inputs/logs 保留。不等于 operation 身份，也不决定下游读哪个 TRA。"

msgid ""
"Native output filename, default \"events.tra.gz\". Existing products receive numbered suffixes; "
"no historical product is overwritten."
msgstr "原生文件名，默认 \"events.tra.gz\"；冲突编号，不覆盖历史。"

msgid "Native command timeout in seconds, default None (unlimited)."
msgstr "原生命令超时，秒，默认 None 不限时。"

msgid ""
"False (default) preserves native HOME. True gives this native command private settings after "
"setup, without modifying cfg contents."
msgstr "默认 False 保留 HOME；True 在 setup 后赋本次命令私有设置，不改 cfg。"

msgid ""
"Legacy explicit group selector, default None. A different value conflicts with a constructor-"
"bound analysis_id."
msgstr "旧显式组选择器，默认 None。不得与构造 analysis_id 冲突。"

msgid "Python log capture, currently \"full\" (default), not a native flag."
msgstr "Python 日志捕获，当前默认 \"full\"，不是原生 flag。"

msgid ""
"Native -C overrides: key underscores become dots; booleans become true/false, other values use "
"str without further rewriting. With a constructor-bound definition these override the baseline "
"for THIS COMMAND ONLY. They are recorded in execution_overrides and never become later calls' "
"defaults. Legacy groups retain their recorded default/variant behavior until explicitly opened as"
" a bound definition."
msgstr ""
"原生 -C 覆盖：键下划线转点，布尔 true/false，其他 str，不进一步改写。绑定时仅覆盖本次基准，存 execution_overrides，不成为后续默认。旧组在显式绑定前保留原 "
"default/变体行为。"

msgid ""
"Native outputs['tra'], exact upstream references, execution UUID, root manifest path and optional"
" nonempty stdout/stderr paths. Nonempty products and exit zero establish execution success, not "
"scientific correctness. ROOT data extraction is a separate call."
msgstr "原生 outputs[\"tra\"]、精确上游、UUID、根 manifest 和可选非空 stdout/stderr 路径。非空产物加零退出只证明执行成功；ROOT 数值另行提取。"

msgid ""
"Input/definition conflict, multiple input candidates, absent prepared     components, invalid "
"output/settings, or missing required configuration."
msgstr "输入/定义冲突、多候选、准备好的成分缺失、无效输出/设置或缺主配置。"

msgid "A bound configuration or selected data file cannot be read."
msgstr "无法读取绑定 cfg 或选定数据文件。"

msgid ""
"Native preparation, execution, timeout or output validation fails.     The independent failed "
"record and nonempty logs remain available."
msgstr "原生准备、执行、超时或输出校验失败，独立失败记录与非空日志仍保留。"

msgid ""
"Each native command applies its own selections from the main cfg plus explicit overrides; reading"
" selected TRA does not inherit the command parameters that produced it. task is a label only. "
"Reopening a group uses manifest operation/status/UUID/path records, not directory names. Setup "
"executes in a child process; the parent environment is unchanged. Declared components require no "
"preliminary add_external_components(). Their include list and all real parent references are "
"recorded in this same extract_events execution; no intermediate combined TRA is created. No event"
" parsing, time shift or physical scaling is performed."
msgstr ""
"每命令应用自己的主 cfg 与显式覆盖；TRA 接续不继承产生它的参数。task 只标签，重开按 manifest operation/status/UUID/path "
"选择，不按目录名。setup 在子进程，父环境不变。成分不需预先 add_external_components()，include 列表与全部父节点就在本次 extract_events "
"记录，不建中间 combined TRA。不解析事件、改时钟或物理缩放。"

msgid "Execute native Mimrec image (-i) with explicit data provenance."
msgstr "执行原生 Mimrec image (-i)，记录精确来源。"

msgid ""
"Exact TRA result/reference for this command, default None. For a bound analysis it must belong to"
" that analysis's data chain. None queries the root manifest (not the filesystem): select this "
"group's unique successful extract_events record first, otherwise its unique successful "
"add_external_components record, otherwise the registered primary input. Multiple successful "
"candidates require an explicit result, never latest/mtime or a fixed task folder name."
msgstr ""
"本次精确 TRA 结果/引用，默认 None。绑定时必须属于自身数据链；None 依根 manifest 选本组唯一成功 extract_events，再唯一成功 "
"add_external_components，最后登记 primary。多候选需显式结果，不按 latest/mtime 或固定 task 目录。"

msgid ""
"Arbitrary output directory label, default \"image\". Letters, digits, underscores and hyphens, "
"starting with a letter/digit. inputs/logs are reserved. This is NOT the operation identity and "
"does not identify which extracted TRA a downstream command reads."
msgstr "输出目录标签，默认 \"image\"，合法字符字母/数字/下划线/连字符且以字母/数字开头，inputs/logs 保留。不等于 operation，也不标识下游 TRA。"

msgid ""
"Native output filename, default \"image.root\". Existing products receive numbered suffixes; no "
"historical product is overwritten."
msgstr "原生文件名，默认 \"image.root\"，冲突加编号，不覆盖历史。"

msgid ""
"Native outputs['image'], exact upstream references, execution UUID, root manifest path and "
"optional nonempty stdout/stderr paths. Nonempty products and exit zero establish execution "
"success, not scientific correctness. ROOT data extraction is a separate call."
msgstr "outputs[\"image\"]、精确上游、execution UUID、根 manifest 及可选非空日志路径。零退出加非空产物仅为执行验证，ROOT 读取另行调用。"

msgid ""
"Each native command applies its own selections from the main cfg plus explicit overrides; reading"
" selected TRA does not inherit the command parameters that produced it. task is a label only. "
"Reopening a group uses manifest operation/status/UUID/path records, not directory names. Setup "
"executes in a child process; the parent environment is unchanged. No event parsing, time shift or"
" physical scaling is performed."
msgstr ""
"每命令用主 cfg 加自身覆盖，不继承输入 TRA 的生成参数。task 仅标签。重开按 manifest operation/status/UUID/path，不按目录。setup "
"在子进程，不改父环境。不解析事件、不移动时钟或缩放物理量。"

msgid "Execute native Mimrec spectrum (-s) with explicit data provenance."
msgstr "执行原生 Mimrec spectrum (-s)，记录精确来源。"

msgid ""
"Arbitrary output directory label, default \"spectrum\". Letters, digits, underscores and hyphens,"
" starting with a letter/digit. inputs/logs are reserved. This is NOT the operation identity and "
"does not identify which extracted TRA a downstream command reads."
msgstr "输出目录标签，默认 \"spectrum\"，字母/数字/下划线/连字符，首字符字母/数字；inputs/logs 保留。不等于 operation，也不决定上游 TRA。"

msgid ""
"Native output filename, default \"spectrum.root\". Existing products receive numbered suffixes; "
"no historical product is overwritten."
msgstr "原生文件名，默认 \"spectrum.root\"，冲突编号，不覆盖历史。"

msgid ""
"Native outputs['spectrum'], exact upstream references, execution UUID, root manifest path and "
"optional nonempty stdout/stderr paths. Nonempty products and exit zero establish execution "
"success, not scientific correctness. ROOT data extraction is a separate call."
msgstr "outputs[\"spectrum\"]、精确上游、UUID、根 manifest、非空日志路径。零退出/非空产物仅为执行验证，ROOT 数值另行读取。"

msgid ""
"spectrum is passed the removed working_space argument or a positional     input; bind the root in"
" Mimrec() and use input_data for exact results."
msgstr "spectrum 收到已移除的 working_space 或位置输入；应构造绑定根，并用 input_data 指定精确结果。"

msgid "Execute native Mimrec arm (-a) with explicit data provenance."
msgstr "执行原生 Mimrec arm (-a)，记录精确来源。"

msgid ""
"Arbitrary output directory label, default \"arm\". Letters, digits, underscores and hyphens, "
"starting with a letter/digit. inputs/logs are reserved. This is NOT the operation identity and "
"does not identify which extracted TRA a downstream command reads."
msgstr "输出目录标签，默认 \"arm\"。字母/数字/下划线/连字符，首字符字母/数字；inputs/logs 保留。不是 operation 身份，也不决定下游读取的 TRA。"

msgid ""
"Native output filename, default \"arm.root\". Existing products receive numbered suffixes; no "
"historical product is overwritten."
msgstr "原生文件名，默认 \"arm.root\"；已占用则编号，不覆盖历史。"

msgid ""
"Native outputs['arm'], exact upstream references, execution UUID, root manifest path and optional"
" nonempty stdout/stderr paths. Nonempty products and exit zero establish execution success, not "
"scientific correctness. ROOT data extraction is a separate call."
msgstr "outputs[\"arm\"]、精确上游、UUID、根 manifest 与可选非空日志路径。零退出加非空产物只表示执行成功，不证明科学正确性。ROOT 数值需另行读取。"

msgid "Prepared component workflow"
msgstr "准备好成分的组合流程"

msgid "Extract the declared dataset once, then produce image and spectrum."
msgstr "对声明数据提取一次，再生成图像和谱。"

msgid ""
"Analysis constructed with working_space, analysis_id, main configuration and explicit "
"external_components. Its primary input and all components must already be prepared. The function "
"does not classify components."
msgstr "已绑定 working_space、analysis_id、主配置及显式 external_components 的分析对象。主输入和成分必须已准备，不分类成分。"

msgid ""
"Native -C keyword overrides for each operation separately, default None. Keys replace _ with .; "
"values follow the Mimrec native passthrough rule. Use these only for native settings, not Python "
"method parameters. No operation inherits overrides from the preceding one."
msgstr "三个操作各自的原生 -C 覆盖字典，默认 None。键 _ 转 .，值遵循 Mimrec 原生透传规则。仅传原生设置，不传 Python 方法选项；不继承前一命令覆盖。"

msgid "Positive timeout in seconds for each command, default None (unlimited)."
msgstr "各命令的正数秒超时，默认 None 不限时。"

msgid ""
"False (default) preserves native HOME; True isolates each command's native settings without "
"editing the main configuration."
msgstr "默认 False 保留原生 HOME；True 分别隔离各命令设置，不编辑主 cfg。"

msgid ""
"``selected`` contains the combined, selected TRA product; ``image`` and ``spectrum`` contain "
"native ROOT products. Each has a separate execution UUID and immutable upstream references. Use "
"extract_image/extract_spectrum separately to read numerical results into memory."
msgstr ""
"``selected`` 为组合并筛选后的 TRA；``image`` 与 ``spectrum`` 为原生 ROOT。三者各有 UUID 与不可变上游引用；另用 "
"extract_image/extract_spectrum 读入内存。"

msgid ""
"The bound definition/components are invalid or an override dictionary     contains Python method "
"options rather than native settings."
msgstr "绑定定义/成分无效，或覆盖字典混入 Python 方法参数。"

msgid ""
"A native step fails. Successful earlier steps and the failed record     remain available; "
"subsequent steps are not started."
msgstr "某个原生步骤失败。此前成功结果及失败记录保留，后续不启动。"

msgid ""
"Every downstream step receives an explicit result. Repeating this function preserves historical "
"products and does not guess the latest extraction. Prepare background time windows separately "
"with native extract_events and pass those results as external_components. No random window "
"selection, event parsing, time alignment, exposure/flux scaling or study scheduler is implemented"
" here. One native -x reads the primary and declared components and applies extraction settings. "
"Repeated calls with components start from the declared dataset, not a previous extraction. No "
"intermediate combined TRA or separate combination command is created."
msgstr ""
"下游均显式接结果。重复调用保留历史，不猜最新提取。背景窗口需预先用原生 extract_events 准备，结果作为 "
"external_components。本函数不随机抽窗、不解析事件、不对齐时钟、不缩放曝光/流量、不调度 study。一次 -x 读取声明主数据与成分并筛选；重复从声明集开始，不建中间 "
"combined TRA 或单独组合命令。"

msgid "Mimrec ROOT data extraction"
msgstr "Mimrec ROOT 数据提取"

msgid ""
"These functions read files on demand in an isolated ROOT Python subprocess. See :doc:`../mimrec` "
"for units, object selection and coordinate limits."
msgstr "在隔离的 ROOT Python 子进程按需读取。单位、对象选择与坐标边界见 :doc:`../mimrec`。"

msgid "Discover TH1/TH2 histograms recursively in directories and Canvas/Pad."
msgstr "递归发现目录和 Canvas/Pad 中的 TH1/TH2。"

msgid "A result with exactly one ROOT product across all groups, or a ROOT path."
msgstr "全部产物组中恰有一个 ROOT 文件的结果，或 ROOT 文件路径。"

msgid ""
"None (default) uses direct execution. A setup-script runtime initializes ROOT in a separate "
"child, allowing a Python 3.10 MEGAlib environment and a Python 3.12 caller. No PyROOT is imported"
" into the caller."
msgstr ""
"默认 None 使用 direct。setup-script 在独立子进程初始化 ROOT，允许 Python 3.10 MEGAlib 与 Python 3.12 调用者共存，父进程不导入 "
"PyROOT。"

msgid ""
"Child Python executable, default None: current Python for direct mode, or ``python`` resolved "
"after setup for setup-script mode. Select the executable belonging to ROOT, never a different "
"version's PyROOT path."
msgstr "子 Python 路径，默认 None：direct 用当前解释器，setup 模式用初始化后解析的 python。请选择 ROOT 对应解释器，不要导入其他版本的 PyROOT 路径。"

msgid "Whole child-process timeout in seconds, default 120; None disables it."
msgstr "子进程整体超时，秒，默认 120；None 不限时。"

msgid ""
"Every supported histogram, with exact object_path selectors. All key cycles are included; no "
"latest-cycle or fixed primitive index is used. TH3 and profiles are excluded. An empty file "
"returns an empty tuple."
msgstr "所有受支持直方图及精确 object_path。保留全部 key cycle，不取最新或固定 primitive 索引；排除 TH3/profile。空文件返回空元组。"

msgid "Input path, executable or setup script is missing."
msgstr "缺少输入文件、可执行程序或 setup 脚本。"

msgid "Result has multiple/no ROOT products, or timeout is not positive."
msgstr "结果没有/含多个 ROOT，或 timeout 非正。"

msgid "ROOT import/read fails, the child fails, or the timeout expires."
msgstr "ROOT 导入/读取失败、子进程失败或超时。"

msgid "Read one 1D spectrum into memory without writing persistent files."
msgstr "读取一维谱到内存，不写持久文件。"

msgid ""
"Mimrec spectrum result (one .root in outputs['spectrum']) or ROOT path. PNG products cannot be "
"converted back to histogram bins."
msgstr "Mimrec 谱结果（outputs[\"spectrum\"] 中一个 .root）或 ROOT 路径。PNG 不能恢复直方图 bins。"

msgid ""
"Exact selector from list_root_objects. Default None requires exactly one 1D histogram; multiple "
"candidates or key cycles require explicit choice."
msgstr "list_root_objects 返回的精确选择器。默认 None 要求唯一一维直方图；多个对象/cycle 需明确选择。"

msgid ""
"Default None uses direct execution; a setup-script runtime initializes the independent ROOT "
"child. The analysis process never imports PyROOT."
msgstr "默认 None 为 direct；setup-script 初始化独立 ROOT 子进程。分析进程始终不导入 PyROOT。"

msgid ""
"ROOT-compatible child Python. Default None uses current Python in direct mode or ``python`` after"
" setup. No megalibpy installation is needed in the child environment, only PyROOT and Python "
">=3.10."
msgstr ""
"ROOT 兼容子 Python。None 时 direct 用当前 Python，setup 后用 python。子环境不需 megalibpy，只需 PyROOT 和 Python "
">=3.10。"

msgid "Child timeout in seconds, default 120; None disables the timeout."
msgstr "子进程超时，秒，默认 120；None 取消。"

msgid ""
"Bin edges, contents, labels/units, separate underflow/overflow and source metadata. total_counts "
"integrates only recognized counts/keV with keV bin widths, or sums explicitly labeled counts. "
"Unknown conventions raise ValueError when total_counts is requested, not during extraction."
msgstr ""
"bin 边界/内容、标签/单位、独立上下溢出和来源元数据。total_counts 仅按已知 counts/keV×keV 宽度积分，或对明确 counts 标签求和。未知约定在访问 "
"total_counts 时抛 ValueError，不妨碍原始提取。"

msgid "Input, executable or setup script is missing."
msgstr "缺少输入、可执行程序或 setup 脚本。"

msgid "The result has no unique ROOT spectrum product or timeout is invalid."
msgstr "谱结果无唯一 ROOT 产物，或 timeout 无效。"

msgid ""
"Histogram choice is ambiguous/missing, ROOT cannot read the file,     PyROOT is unavailable in "
"the child, or the child fails/times out."
msgstr "直方图选择歧义/不存在、ROOT 无法读取、子环境无 PyROOT，或子进程失败/超时。"

msgid ""
"Only regular bins contribute to total_counts. No exposure, flux, background or time scaling is "
"performed. The input file and manifest are read-only. Temporary IPC files are removed on success "
"and failure; no TSV/cache is kept."
msgstr "仅常规 bins 计入 total_counts。不做曝光、流量、背景或时间缩放。文件与 manifest 只读。成功/失败均删除 IPC 临时文件，不保留 TSV/cache。"

msgid "Read one 2D image, preserving native bins and explicit coordinate metadata."
msgstr "读取二维图像，保留原生 bins 与显式坐标元数据。"

msgid "Mimrec image result (one .root in outputs['image']) or a ROOT path."
msgstr "Mimrec 图像结果（outputs[\"image\"] 中一个 .root）或 ROOT 路径。"

msgid ""
"Exact list_root_objects selector. Default None requires one 2D histogram; multiple "
"candidates/cycles require selection, never a latest-file rule."
msgstr "list_root_objects 的精确选择器。None 要求唯一二维直方图；多对象/cycle 需选择，不按最新文件。"

msgid ""
"None (default) uses direct execution. Setup mode initializes a separate ROOT child; no PyROOT is "
"loaded into the calling analysis Python."
msgstr "默认 None 为 direct。setup 在独立 ROOT 子进程初始化，调用分析 Python 不加载 PyROOT。"

msgid ""
"ROOT-compatible Python executable. None uses current Python in direct mode or ``python`` after "
"setup. Child requires PyROOT and Python >=3.10."
msgstr "兼容 ROOT 的 Python。None 时 direct 用当前解释器，setup 后用 python。要求 PyROOT 与 Python >=3.10。"

msgid "Child-process timeout in seconds, default 120; None disables it."
msgstr "子进程超时，秒，默认 120；None 取消。"

msgid ""
"Contents indexed [x, y], native bin edges/titles/units, and metadata. peak_position is the unique"
" maximum pixel's native bin center, not a centroid. peak_galactic_position is a scalar Galactic "
"SkyCoord, available only for a verified rectangular Galactic TGaxis mapping; unknown projections "
"and Hammer images remain unmapped. Tied maxima raise ValueError on access."
msgstr ""
"按 [x, y] 索引的内容、原生边界/标题/单位和元数据。peak_position 是唯一最大像素中心，不是 centroid。peak_galactic_position 是标量 "
"Galactic SkyCoord，仅验证矩形银河 TGaxis 映射后提供；未知投影/Hammer 不映射。并列峰访问时报 ValueError。"

msgid "Result has no unique ROOT image product or timeout is invalid."
msgstr "图像结果无唯一 ROOT 产物，或 timeout 无效。"

msgid ""
"Histogram choice is ambiguous/missing, ROOT read/import fails, or child     execution fails/times"
" out."
msgstr "直方图选择歧义/缺失、ROOT 导入/读取失败，或子进程失败/超时。"

msgid ""
"No longitude sign rule is hardcoded. Coordinates and intensity are not reprojected, normalized or"
" fitted. Flow bins are omitted. Files/manifests are unmodified, and temporary IPC files are "
"removed; no image/TSV is saved."
msgstr "不硬编码经度符号规则。不重投影、归一化或拟合坐标/强度；忽略 flow bins。不改文件/manifest，清理临时 IPC，不保存图像/TSV。"

msgid "A discovered TH1/TH2 histogram (profiles and TH3 are excluded)."
msgstr "发现的 TH1/TH2 直方图，排除 profile 与 TH3。"

msgid ""
"Exact selector including directory key cycles and Canvas/Pad names. Names are URL-escaped; "
"duplicate primitive names receive a 1-based occurrence suffix. Unnamed primitives use "
"``@unnamed``."
msgstr "包含目录 key cycle 和 Canvas/Pad 名称的精确选择器。名称 URL 转义，重复 primitive 用从 1 开始的出现次数后缀，无名对象用 ``@unnamed``。"

msgid "Original ROOT name, concrete class and title, respectively."
msgstr "依次为原始 ROOT 名、具体类和标题。"

msgid "One for spectra or two for images."
msgstr "谱为 1，图像为 2。"

msgid "int"
msgstr "int"

msgid "Unmodified ROOT axis titles; an empty title remains empty."
msgstr "未修改的 ROOT 轴标题；空标题保持空。"

msgid "Detached numerical bin axis with its original title and optional unit."
msgstr "脱离 ROOT 的数值轴，保留原标题与可选单位。"

msgid "Float64 array of length N+1, excluding underflow/overflow edges."
msgstr "长度 N+1 的 Float64 边界数组，不含 underflow/overflow 边界。"

msgid "numpy.ndarray"
msgstr "numpy.ndarray"

msgid "Original ROOT axis title."
msgstr "原始 ROOT 轴标题。"

msgid ""
"Literal trailing bracketed unit, e.g. ``\"keV\"`` or ``\"deg\"``. None means no bracketed unit "
"was supplied; no unit is inferred."
msgstr "标题末尾方括号中的字面单位，如 ``\"keV\"`` 或 ``\"deg\"``。None 表示未提供，不推断单位。"

msgid "str or None"
msgstr "str or None"

msgid "Arithmetic bin centers in the axis unit."
msgstr "轴单位下的算术 bin 中心。"

msgid "Per-bin widths in the axis unit."
msgstr "轴单位下的每 bin 宽度。"

msgid "Detached 1D histogram; no files are generated by this result."
msgstr "脱离 ROOT 的一维直方图结果，不生成文件。"

msgid "Resolved input ROOT filename."
msgstr "已解析的输入 ROOT 文件名。"

msgid "pathlib.Path"
msgstr "pathlib.Path"

msgid "Exact source object and axis titles."
msgstr "精确来源对象与轴标题。"

msgid "ROOTObject"
msgstr "ROOTObject"

msgid "Energy or other native X axis, including all regular bin edges."
msgstr "能量或其他原生 X 轴，包含全部常规 bin 边界。"

msgid "HistogramAxis"
msgstr "HistogramAxis"

msgid "Float64 contents of regular bins, without normalization or rescaling."
msgstr "常规 bins 的 Float64 内容，不归一化或缩放。"

msgid "Unmodified Y-axis title."
msgstr "原始 Y 轴标题。"

msgid ""
"``\"counts/keV\"`` or ``\"counts\"`` for exact recognized count labels; otherwise the bracketed "
"unit, or None. The raw title is always retained."
msgstr "已知精确计数标签对应 ``\"counts/keV\"`` 或 ``\"counts\"``，否则返回方括号单位或 None。始终保留原始标题。"

msgid ""
"Underflow and overflow contents in the original histogram convention. They are excluded from "
"total_counts; density flow bins have no finite energy width and are not integrated."
msgstr "原始直方图约定下的 underflow/overflow 内容，不纳入 total_counts；密度 flow bins 无有限能量宽度，不积分。"

msgid "tuple of float"
msgstr "tuple of float"

msgid "Counts in regular bins, only for verified count conventions."
msgstr "仅对已验证计数约定计算常规 bins 总计数。"

msgid ""
"``counts/keV`` with X unit ``keV`` uses sum(values * bin widths). An exact ``counts`` label uses "
"sum(values). Unknown labels, rates, normalized histograms, profiles and inconsistent units are "
"never blindly width-integrated."
msgstr ""
"``counts/keV`` 且 X 单位 ``keV`` 时 sum(values * bin widths)；精确 ``counts`` 用 "
"sum(values)。未知标签、rate、归一化谱、profile 或单位不一致绝不盲目乘宽积分。"

msgid "The histogram labels do not establish one of these conventions,     or the values are nonfinite."
msgstr "标签无法确定上述计数约定，或数值非有限。"

msgid "float"
msgstr "float"

msgid "Detached 2D histogram with an explicitly defined pixel-maximum position."
msgstr "脱离 ROOT 的二维直方图，明确以最大像素定义位置。"

msgid "Selected object metadata and original titles."
msgstr "选定对象元数据及原始标题。"

msgid "Native histogram axes. Their edges are never reversed or projected."
msgstr "原生直方图轴，边界不反转或投影。"

msgid ""
"Float64 contents, shape (Nx, Ny): values[ix, iy] follows ROOT X then Y. Flow bins are excluded. "
"Use values.T for Matplotlib pcolormesh."
msgstr "Float64 数组，形状 (Nx, Ny)，values[ix, iy] 先 X 后 Y；不含 flow。Matplotlib pcolormesh 使用 values.T。"

msgid "Original Z-axis title, without assuming intensity normalization."
msgstr "原始 Z 轴标题，不假设强度归一化。"

msgid "Bracketed Z-axis unit, e.g. ``\"a.u.\"``, or None."
msgstr "Z 轴方括号单位，例如 ``\"a.u.\"``，或 None。"

msgid ""
"Verified linear TGaxis mapping: longitude = scale * native_x + offset. Includes axis_title, "
"coordinate_system and projection. Recognized only for an explicit horizontal Galactic Longitude "
"[deg] TGaxis spanning the histogram and a Galactic Latitude [deg] Y axis. Otherwise None. In "
"particular, Hammer images are not assumed to have a linear mapping."
msgstr ""
"已验证线性 TGaxis：longitude = scale * native_x + offset。含 "
"axis_title、coordinate_system、projection。仅识别横跨直方图的显式水平 Galactic Longitude [deg] TGaxis 与 Galactic "
"Latitude [deg] Y 轴，否则 None。尤其不假设 Hammer 为线性。"

msgid "dict or None"
msgstr "dict or None"

msgid "Zero-based (ix, iy) of a unique finite maximum."
msgstr "唯一有限最大值的零起始 (ix, iy)。"

msgid ""
"No finite pixels exist, or several pixels share the maximum.     Plateaus are ambiguous; no "
"first-pixel or centroid rule is applied."
msgstr "无有限像素或多个像素并列最大；平台有歧义，不采用首像素或 centroid 规则。"

msgid "tuple of int"
msgstr "tuple of int"

msgid "Native (x, y) bin center of the maximum pixel."
msgstr "最大像素在原生 (x, y) 中的 bin 中心。"

msgid ""
"This is a pixel maximum, not an intensity-weighted centroid or fitted source location. Units are "
"those of x_axis/y_axis. Unknown axes remain histogram coordinates. See peak_indices for ambiguity"
" errors and peak_galactic_position for the separately verified sky mapping."
msgstr ""
"这是像素峰，不是强度加权 centroid 或拟合源位置。单位随 x_axis/y_axis。未知轴保持直方图坐标。歧义错误见 peak_indices；单独验证的天空映射见 "
"peak_galactic_position。"

msgid "Return the maximum pixel center as a Galactic SkyCoord, or None."
msgstr "返回最大像素中心的 Galactic SkyCoord，或 None。"

msgid ""
"Scalar position with frame=\"galactic\", longitude wrapped into [0, 360) degrees and latitude in "
"degrees. Access .l.deg/.b.deg for numeric values, or use .separation() with another sky "
"coordinate. None means no unique explicit rectangular Galactic mapping was verified; no "
"coordinate frame or longitude sign is guessed."
msgstr ""
"标量 frame=\"galactic\"，经度 wrap 到 [0, 360)，纬度为度。用 .l.deg/.b.deg 读值，用 .separation() 求角距。None "
"表示未验证唯一显式矩形银河映射，不猜坐标系或经度符号。"

msgid ""
"A verified mapping exists but the peak is ambiguous/nonfinite, or     its latitude is outside the"
" Galactic coordinate range."
msgstr "映射已验证但峰歧义/非有限，或纬度超银河坐标范围。"

msgid ""
"This is the maximum pixel's center, not a centroid or fitted location. peak_position remains the "
"native (x, y) tuple. This property previously returned an (l, b) tuple; use position.l.deg and "
"position.b.deg instead of unpacking that old return value. No equatorial transformation or "
"inverse Hammer projection is performed."
msgstr ""
"这是最大像素中心，不是 centroid 或拟合。peak_position 仍是原生 (x, y) 元组。此属性原返回 (l, b) 元组；应改用 position.l.deg 与 "
"position.b.deg。不做赤道变换或 Hammer 逆投影。"

msgid "``galactic`` for a verified mapping, otherwise ``unknown``."
msgstr "验证映射时为 ``galactic``，否则 ``unknown``。"

msgid "This describes the optional sky mapping, not the raw peak_position."
msgstr "描述可选天空映射，不是原生 peak_position。"

msgid "``rectangular`` for a verified mapping, otherwise ``unknown``."
msgstr "验证映射时为 ``rectangular``，否则 ``unknown``。"

msgid "The ROOT subprocess failed, or histogram selection was ambiguous."
msgstr "ROOT 子进程失败，或直方图选择歧义。"

msgid ""
"The exception message contains child diagnostics or candidate object paths. This read operation "
"does not create an execution record in the manifest."
msgstr "错误消息包含子进程诊断或候选路径；此只读操作不在 manifest 建立执行记录。"

msgid "Experiment workspace"
msgstr "实验工作区"

msgid ""
"See :doc:`../workspaces` for the index layout, legacy directory handling and the distinction "
"between task identity and execution identity."
msgstr "索引布局、旧目录处理、task 与 execution 身份区别见 :doc:`../workspaces`。"

msgid "Manage a unique Cosima origin and data/configuration analysis groups."
msgstr "管理唯一 Cosima origin 与数据/配置分析组。"

msgid ""
"Experiment root. Construction does not create files. New workspaces use one schema-2 "
"``manifest.json`` containing groups and execution records."
msgstr "实验根。构造不创建文件。新 workspace 使用一个 schema-2 manifest.json 保存组和执行记录。"

msgid ""
"Cosima executes once at ``cosima/``, including failed executions; a rerun requires a new "
"workspace. Revan/Mimrec use ``stage/attempt-NNN`` data groups. Each command retains an "
"independent execution ID and logs within that group. Legacy workspaces remain readable; use a new"
" destination for new executions. Short manifest updates are locked; native processes do not hold "
"the lock."
msgstr ""
"Cosima 在 cosima/ 仅执行一次，包括失败；重跑需新 workspace。Revan/Mimrec 使用 stage/attempt-NNN 数据组，每条命令独立 ID/日志。旧 "
"workspace 只读；新写入用新目标。manifest 短更新加锁，原生进程不持锁。"

msgid "Root manifest, or a legacy workspace index when present."
msgstr "根 manifest，或已存在的旧 workspace 索引。"

msgid "Select a unique successful execution, never an implicit latest result."
msgstr "选择唯一成功执行，绝不隐式取最新。"

msgid "Stage, default ``\"cosima\"``."
msgstr "stage，默认 ``\"cosima\"``。"

msgid "Exact operation/task label; None considers all labels."
msgstr "精确 task 标签，None 考虑所有标签。"

msgid ""
"Workspace-local Revan/Mimrec group name. None selects all groups. Use operation as well when a "
"Mimrec group has several operations."
msgstr "workspace 内 Revan/Mimrec 组名，None 考虑全部组。Mimrec 组有多个操作时应同时指定 operation。"

msgid ""
"Legacy group selector; conflicts with a different analysis_id. Data group basename, e.g. "
"``\"attempt-001\"``. Default none."
msgstr "旧组选择器，与不同 analysis_id 冲突。值为数据组 basename，如 ``\"attempt-001\"``，默认 None。"

msgid "Native operation, e.g. ``\"extract_events\"`` or ``\"image\"``. Default none."
msgstr "原生操作，例如 ``\"extract_events\"`` 或 ``\"image\"``，默认 None。"

msgid "Selected record with workspace context and exact execution ID."
msgstr "带 workspace 上下文与精确 execution ID 的结果。"

msgid ""
"No successful execution exists or the choice is ambiguous. Repeated     successful operations "
"require an explicit saved result/reference."
msgstr "无成功记录或有歧义。重复成功操作需显式保存结果/引用。"

msgid "Attach one existing successful Cosima result without copying products."
msgstr "关联一个既有成功 Cosima 结果，不复制产物。"

msgid "Exact successful native simulation result, including legacy records."
msgstr "精确成功模拟结果，支持旧记录。"

msgid "A different origin is already registered, or the input is not Cosima."
msgstr "已登记不同 origin，或输入不是 Cosima。"

msgid "Registered external simulation input."
msgstr "已登记外部模拟输入。"

msgid "Registered external TRA input."
msgstr "已登记外部 TRA 输入。"

msgid "Register an external simulation origin without copying data."
msgstr "登记外部模拟 origin，不复制数据。"

msgid "Selected external sim/evta entry file."
msgstr "选定的外部 sim/evta 入口文件。"

msgid "A different origin is already registered."
msgstr "已登记不同 origin。"

msgid "Register a TRA origin for an empty workspace, preserving existing origins."
msgstr "为空 workspace 登记 TRA origin，保留已有 origin。"

msgid "External TRA input; additional component inputs remain step metadata."
msgstr "外部 TRA 输入；额外成分仅作为步骤元数据。"

msgid "Results and failures"
msgstr "结果与失败"

msgid ""
"Successful calls return ``ExecutionResult``. Failed attempts raise ``ExecutionError`` with the "
"manifest path and the native return code when available. A zero native return code can still "
"produce an error if expected output files are missing."
msgstr "成功返回 ``ExecutionResult``，失败抛 ``ExecutionError``，包含 manifest 路径与可获得的原生返回码。即使退出码零，缺少预期产物也会报错。"

msgid "A successful tool execution and paths to its persistent records."
msgstr "成功的工具执行及其持久记录路径。"

msgid "Absolute execution workspace directory."
msgstr "执行工作目录的绝对路径。"

msgid ""
"Product groups containing sorted absolute file paths. Cosima uses the ``\"sim\"`` group, which "
"may contain multiple files."
msgstr "产物组对应排序的绝对路径。Cosima 使用 \"sim\" 组，可有多个文件。"

msgid ""
"Absolute root manifest path for managed executions, or standalone record. Use record to read this"
" execution's status and metadata by ID."
msgstr "受管理执行的根 manifest 绝对路径，或独立记录。用 record 按 ID 读取该执行状态/元数据。"

msgid "Stdout log path, or None when empty and removed."
msgstr "stdout 日志路径，空日志删除后为 None。"

msgid "Absolute path to the stderr log, or None when empty and removed."
msgstr "stderr 绝对路径，空日志删除后为 None。"

msgid ""
"Process return code, zero for results returned by the executor. Defaults to zero. Failed attempts"
" raise ``ExecutionError`` instead."
msgstr "进程退出码，executor 返回结果时为零，默认零。失败改抛 ExecutionError。"

msgid ""
"Persistent UUID identifying this execution attempt independently of its directory name. ``None`` "
"supports manually constructed legacy results. This is not a task ID: reruns receive different "
"execution IDs."
msgstr "持久 UUID，独立于目录名标识本次执行；None 支持手工旧结果。不是 task ID，重跑产生新 UUID。"

msgid "Experiment root when managed by ``SimulationWorkspace``; otherwise none."
msgstr "SimulationWorkspace 管理时的实验根，否则 None。"

msgid "Data group directory with shared inputs/logs and operation products."
msgstr "共享 inputs/logs 和操作产物的数据组目录。"

msgid "Discovered output files, for example ``result.outputs[\"sim\"]``."
msgstr "发现的输出，例如 ``result.outputs[\"sim\"]``。"

msgid "dict of str to tuple of pathlib.Path"
msgstr "dict of str to tuple of pathlib.Path"

msgid "Persistent metadata and validation record."
msgstr "持久元数据与验证记录。"

msgid "Retained stdout, or None if empty. Capture mode is recorded in logs.capture."
msgstr "保留 stdout，空则 None；捕获模式在 logs.capture 中。"

msgid "Retained stderr, or None if empty."
msgstr "保留 stderr，空则 None。"

msgid "Zero when returned after successful execution and output checks."
msgstr "执行与输出检查成功时返回零。"

msgid "Execution identity stored in the manifest, or ``None`` for legacy objects."
msgstr "manifest 中的 execution 身份，旧对象可为 None。"

msgid "Experiment root for managed executions; ``None`` for standalone attempts."
msgstr "受管理执行的实验根；独立执行为 None。"

msgid ""
"A successful result establishes process success and the documented file checks, not the "
"scientific validity of the data. It does not load simulation products into memory. Read the files"
" only when needed for subsequent steps."
msgstr "成功结果只证明进程与文档所述文件检查，不证明科学有效性。不将模拟产物加载到内存，下游按需读文件。"

msgid "This execution's record, resolved by ID in a central manifest."
msgstr "从集中 manifest 按 ID 解析本次执行记录。"

msgid ""
"Returns a newly read dictionary. Other workspace executions do not change this result's identity."
" Legacy standalone manifests are supported."
msgstr "返回新读取的字典。追加其他 workspace 执行不改变本结果身份。支持旧独立 manifest。"

msgid "dict"
msgstr "dict"

msgid "Select a product group for a downstream execution plan."
msgstr "为下游执行计划选择产物组。"

msgid "Product group present in :attr:`outputs`, for example ``\"sim\"``."
msgstr ":attr:`outputs` 中的组，例如 ``\"sim\"``。"

msgid ""
"Explicit subset, checked against the persisted group by the executor. ``None`` selects every file"
" in the group."
msgstr "显式文件子集，由 executor 对持久组检查。None 选该组全部文件。"

msgid ""
"Reference to this manifest and the selected product group. The executor validates the persisted "
"record when consuming it."
msgstr "指向此 manifest 及产物组的引用，消费时验证持久记录。"

msgid "The requested group is absent from this result."
msgstr "该结果中不存在所请求组。"

msgid "A preparation, process, or output-validation failure."
msgstr "准备、进程或输出校验失败。"

msgid "Human-readable failure description. The exception's display text also includes the manifest path."
msgstr "可读错误说明，异常显示文本也包含 manifest 路径。"

msgid ""
"Path to the execution's persistent JSON record. Standard-output and logs are located through the "
"selected execution record."
msgstr "持久 JSON 记录路径，stdout 与日志通过选定执行记录定位。"

msgid ""
"Native process return code, or ``None`` if no process was started. Zero is possible when process "
"execution succeeded but output validation failed. On POSIX, a negative value indicates "
"termination by a signal."
msgstr "原生返回码，未启动则 None。原生成功但输出校验失败可为零。POSIX 负值代表信号终止。"

msgid "Exact failed execution ID in a central workspace manifest; default none."
msgstr "根 manifest 内精确失败 execution ID，默认 None。"

msgid "Record containing the final status, error description, and available command and input metadata."
msgstr "含最终状态、错误及可用命令/输入元数据的记录。"

msgid "ID selecting this failure within the root manifest."
msgstr "用于根 manifest 选择此次失败的 ID。"

msgid "Process outcome as described above. Defaults to ``None``."
msgstr "上述进程结果，默认 None。"

msgid "int or None"
msgstr "int or None"

msgid ""
"The original preparation or subprocess exception is available through ``error.__cause__``. "
"Argument errors and failures creating the initial workspace may be raised directly before a "
"manifest exists."
msgstr "原始准备/子进程异常保存在 ``error.__cause__``。参数错误或初始 workspace 创建失败可能在 manifest 建立前直接抛出。"

msgid "Executor extension interface"
msgstr "执行器扩展接口"

msgid "This plan model is used by tool adapters. It is not required for ordinary Cosima calls."
msgstr "工具适配器使用此 plan 模型，普通 Cosima 调用不需要。"

msgid "Describe a command for the shared executor without starting a process."
msgstr "描述交给共享 executor 的命令，不启动进程。"

msgid ""
"Nonempty argument sequence beginning with an executable name or path. Each argument is a separate"
" item; shell redirections are not interpreted."
msgstr "以可执行名称/路径开始的非空参数序列，每项独立，不解释 shell 重定向。"

msgid ""
"Working directory for the child process. Tool-specific preparation supplies an absolute path; the"
" parent working directory is unchanged."
msgstr "子进程 cwd。工具准备时提供绝对路径，不修改父 cwd。"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Product groups mapped to glob patterns relative to the workspace's ``products/`` directory. Every"
" group must match at least one nonempty regular file for execution to succeed, for example "
"``{\"sim\": \"events*.sim.gz\"}``."
msgstr "产物组到相对 workspace products/ 的 glob 映射。每组至少匹配一个非空普通文件才成功，例如 ``{\"sim\": \"events*.sim.gz\"}``。"

msgid ""
"JSON-serializable tool-specific fields merged into the manifest. Defaults to an empty dictionary."
" Reserved execution-record keys such as ``status``, ``execution_id`` and ``upstream`` are "
"rejected."
msgstr "合并进 manifest 的 JSON 可序列化工具字段，默认空字典；拒绝 status、execution_id、upstream 等保留键。"

msgid ""
"Explicit upstream product selections, defaulting to no parents. Multiple inputs and multiple "
"consumers are allowed; no linear stage order is imposed. Each upstream manifest is validated and "
"snapshotted."
msgstr "显式上游产物选择，默认无父节点。允许多输入/多消费者，不强制线性 stage 顺序；各上游记录验证并快照。"

msgid ""
"Tool-only environment overrides, applied after setup-script execution. Recorded in the manifest; "
"do not use for secrets. Defaults to none."
msgstr "工具专属环境覆盖，在 setup 后应用并登记 manifest，不用于秘密信息。默认 None。"

msgid ""
"This is an executor extension interface. Normal users call ``Cosima`` or ``Revan`` rather than "
"constructing plans. Frozen dataclasses prevent field rebinding, but do not make nested "
"dictionaries immutable."
msgstr "这是 executor 扩展接口；普通用户直接调用 Cosima/Revan。冻结 dataclass 禁止字段重新绑定，但嵌套字典不因此不可变。"

msgid "Select an upstream execution's product group for a tool adapter."
msgstr "为工具适配器选择上游执行的产物组。"

msgid ""
"Root workspace manifest, selected by execution_id, or a legacy standalone execution manifest. "
"Local upstreams use ID links; external selected records are snapshotted before launch."
msgstr "由 execution_id 选择的根 manifest 或旧独立执行记录。同 workspace 用 ID 链接，外部只快照选定记录。"

msgid "Explicit product group to consume, such as ``\"sim\"`` or ``\"tra\"``."
msgstr "消费的显式组，例如 sim 或 tra。"

msgid ""
"Expected upstream identity, mandatory for central workspace manifests. Results supply their ID "
"automatically; None supports legacy records."
msgstr "预期上游身份，集中 workspace 必需。结果自动提供 ID；None 支持旧记录。"

msgid ""
"Explicit subset of the group's files. ``None`` selects the whole group. Relative selections are "
"resolved against the upstream execution root."
msgstr "显式文件子集，None 为全组；相对选择按上游执行目录解析。"

msgid "Experiment hint carried by managed results; not part of execution identity."
msgstr "受管理结果携带的实验提示，不属于执行身份。"

msgid ""
"This reference records lineage; the tool adapter must also pass these files to the native "
"command. Products are referenced, not copied or fully hashed. Multiple downstream plans may "
"reference the same upstream execution."
msgstr "此引用记录来源链路，适配器仍需把文件传原生命令。产物引用而不复制或完整 hash。多个下游计划可引用同一上游执行。"
